<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" id="home">

<meta http-equiv="content-type" content="text/html;charset=utf-8" />

<head>
  <title>Message Queue Monitoring | Kafka, RabbitMQ, SQS, Pub/Sub & More | OneUptime</title>
  <meta name="description"
    content="Every queue, topic and subscription your applications use, discovered from OpenTelemetry traces and broker metrics: producers and consumers, backlog, consumer lag and dead letters, with alerts wired to on-call. Open source.">
  <%- include('head', {
    enableGoogleTagManager: typeof enableGoogleTagManager !== 'undefined' ? enableGoogleTagManager : false
}) -%>
</head>

<body>
  <%- include('nav') -%>

  <main id="main-content">
    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <div class="relative isolate overflow-hidden bg-white" id="queues-hero-section">
      <!-- Subtle grid pattern background -->
      <div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 h-full w-full bg-white bg-[linear-gradient(to_right,#f0f0f0_1px,transparent_1px),linear-gradient(to_bottom,#f0f0f0_1px,transparent_1px)] bg-[size:4rem_4rem] [mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse_60%_50%_at_50%_0%,#000_70%,transparent_110%)]"></div>

      <!-- Grid glow effect that follows cursor - indigo color -->
      <div id="queues-grid-glow" class="absolute inset-0 -z-9 pointer-events-none" style="opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.3s ease-out; background: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.3) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.3) 1px, transparent 1px); background-size: 4rem 4rem; -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(circle 250px at var(--mouse-x, 50%) var(--mouse-y, 50%), black 0%, transparent 100%); mask-image: radial-gradient(circle 250px at var(--mouse-x, 50%) var(--mouse-y, 50%), black 0%, transparent 100%);"></div>

      <div class="py-20 sm:py-28 lg:py-32">
        <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 lg:px-8">
          <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
            <!-- Minimal badge -->
            <p class="text-sm font-medium text-indigo-600 mb-4">OpenTelemetry Native Queue Monitoring</p>

            <h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">
              Every queue and topic, found and monitored
            </h1>
            <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-8 text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
              OneUptime finds the queues, topics and subscriptions your applications use in the messaging spans they already send, and in your brokers' own metrics. Each one gets its own page: messages published and consumed, the services on each side, processing time, and the broker's backlog, consumer lag and dead letters.
            </p>

            <div class="mt-10 flex items-center justify-center gap-x-6">
              <a href="/accounts/register"
                class="rounded-lg bg-gray-900 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-sm hover:bg-gray-800 transition-colors">
                Get started
              </a>
              <a href="/enterprise/demo" class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-900 hover:text-gray-600 transition-colors">
                Request demo <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
              </a>
            </div>

            <!-- Subtle feature list -->
            <div class="mt-12 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-8 gap-y-3 text-sm text-gray-500">
              <span>Auto-discovered</span>
              <span class="max-sm:hidden sm:inline text-gray-300">|</span>
              <span>Producers & consumers</span>
              <span class="max-sm:hidden sm:inline text-gray-300">|</span>
              <span>Backlog & consumer lag</span>
              <span class="max-sm:hidden sm:inline text-gray-300">|</span>
              <span><%= queues.systemCount %> messaging systems</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Hero visual - Queues list mockup -->
          <div class="mt-16 sm:mt-20">
            <div class="relative mx-auto max-w-5xl">
              <div class="rounded-xl bg-gray-900/5 p-1.5 ring-1 ring-gray-900/10">
                <!-- Queues Mockup -->
                <div class="rounded-lg bg-white shadow-lg overflow-hidden">
                  <!-- Header bar -->
                  <div class="bg-gray-50 px-6 py-3 flex items-center justify-between border-b border-gray-200">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                      <div class="flex gap-1.5">
                        <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-red-400"></div>
                        <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-yellow-400"></div>
                        <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-green-400"></div>
                      </div>
                      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                        <%- include('./Partials/icons/queues', {iconClass: 'h-4 w-4'}) %>
                        <span class="text-sm text-gray-700 font-semibold">Queues</span>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                      <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1 bg-white rounded-md border border-gray-200 text-xs text-gray-500">
                        <svg class="h-3 w-3 text-gray-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 6v6h4.5m4.5 0a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
                        </svg>
                        Last 1 hour
                      </div>
                      <span class="max-sm:hidden sm:flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1 bg-indigo-50 rounded-md text-xs font-medium text-indigo-600 border border-indigo-200">
                        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-500 animate-pulse"></span>
                        38 queues
                      </span>
                    </div>
                  </div>

                  <!-- Dashboard content -->
                  <div class="p-5">
                    <!-- Top stats row -->
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 mb-5 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-5">
                      <div class="bg-white rounded-lg p-3.5 border border-gray-200 shadow-sm">
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
                          <div class="text-[10px] font-medium text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Queues</div>
                          <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-md bg-indigo-50 flex items-center justify-center">
                            <%- include('./Partials/icons/queues', {iconClass: 'w-3.5 h-3.5'}) %>
                          </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">38</div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-1 mt-1">
                          <span class="w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-indigo-500"></span>
                          <span class="text-[10px] text-indigo-600 font-medium">6 found this week</span>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                      <div class="bg-white rounded-lg p-3.5 border border-gray-200 shadow-sm">
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
                          <div class="text-[10px] font-medium text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Published</div>
                          <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-md bg-sky-50 flex items-center justify-center">
                            <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-sky-600" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6 12L3.269 3.126A59.768 59.768 0 0121.485 12 59.77 59.77 0 013.27 20.876L5.999 12zm0 0h7.5" />
                            </svg>
                          </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">4.6M</div>
                        <div class="text-[10px] text-gray-400 mt-1">from 27 services</div>
                      </div>
                      <div class="bg-white rounded-lg p-3.5 border border-gray-200 shadow-sm">
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
                          <div class="text-[10px] font-medium text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Error rate</div>
                          <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-md bg-rose-50 flex items-center justify-center">
                            <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-rose-600" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 9v3.75m9-.75a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0zm-9 3.75h.008v.008H12v-.008z" />
                            </svg>
                          </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">0.2%</div>
                        <div class="w-full bg-gray-100 rounded-full h-1.5 mt-2">
                          <div class="bg-rose-400 h-1.5 rounded-full" style="width: 2%"></div>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                      <div class="bg-white rounded-lg p-3.5 border border-gray-200 shadow-sm">
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
                          <div class="text-[10px] font-medium text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-wider">p95 processing</div>
                          <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-md bg-amber-50 flex items-center justify-center">
                            <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-amber-600" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 6v6h4.5m4.5 0a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z" />
                            </svg>
                          </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">42 ms</div>
                        <div class="text-[10px] text-gray-400 mt-1">as the consumers measure it</div>
                      </div>
                      <div class="bg-white rounded-lg p-3.5 border border-gray-200 shadow-sm">
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
                          <div class="text-[10px] font-medium text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Broker health</div>
                          <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-md bg-violet-50 flex items-center justify-center">
                            <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-violet-600" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 13.125C3 12.504 3.504 12 4.125 12h2.25c.621 0 1.125.504 1.125 1.125v6.75C7.5 20.496 6.996 21 6.375 21h-2.25A1.125 1.125 0 013 19.875v-6.75zM9.75 8.625c0-.621.504-1.125 1.125-1.125h2.25c.621 0 1.125.504 1.125 1.125v11.25c0 .621-.504 1.125-1.125 1.125h-2.25a1.125 1.125 0 01-1.125-1.125V8.625zM16.5 4.125c0-.621.504-1.125 1.125-1.125h2.25C20.496 3 21 3.504 21 4.125v15.75c0 .621-.504 1.125-1.125 1.125h-2.25a1.125 1.125 0 01-1.125-1.125V4.125z" />
                            </svg>
                          </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">29<span class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-400"> / 38</span></div>
                        <div class="w-full bg-gray-100 rounded-full h-1.5 mt-2">
                          <div class="bg-violet-400 h-1.5 rounded-full" style="width: 76%"></div>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Charts row -->
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-3 mb-5 md:grid-cols-3">
                      <!-- Messages chart -->
                      <div class="md:col-span-2 bg-white rounded-lg border border-gray-200 shadow-sm p-4">
                        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
                          <div>
                            <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-800">Messages from applications</div>
                            <div class="text-[10px] text-gray-400 mt-0.5">Publish and consumer spans, all queues</div>
                          </div>
                          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-1">
                              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500"></span>
                              <span class="text-[10px] text-gray-500">Published</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="flex items-center gap-1">
                              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>
                              <span class="text-[10px] text-gray-500">Consumed</span>
                            </div>
                          </div>
                        </div>
                        <!-- SVG Chart -->
                        <!-- Drawn at the card's own aspect ratio, so the lines span its full width -->
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 640 100" class="w-full h-auto">
                          <defs>
                            <linearGradient id="queuesPublishedGrad" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="0%" y2="100%">
                              <stop offset="0%" style="stop-color:#6366f1;stop-opacity:0.2"/>
                              <stop offset="100%" style="stop-color:#6366f1;stop-opacity:0"/>
                            </linearGradient>
                          </defs>
                          <!-- Grid lines -->
                          <line x1="0" y1="25" x2="640" y2="25" stroke="#f3f4f6" stroke-width="1"/>
                          <line x1="0" y1="50" x2="640" y2="50" stroke="#f3f4f6" stroke-width="1"/>
                          <line x1="0" y1="75" x2="640" y2="75" stroke="#f3f4f6" stroke-width="1"/>
                          <!-- Published fill -->
                          <path d="M0,56 L40,52 L80,54 L120,47 L160,44 L200,48 L240,41 L280,36 L320,40 L360,34 L400,31 L440,35 L480,30 L520,27 L560,32 L600,28 L640,25 L640,100 L0,100 Z" fill="url(#queuesPublishedGrad)"/>
                          <!-- Published line -->
                          <path d="M0,56 L40,52 L80,54 L120,47 L160,44 L200,48 L240,41 L280,36 L320,40 L360,34 L400,31 L440,35 L480,30 L520,27 L560,32 L600,28 L640,25" fill="none" stroke="#6366f1" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                          <!-- Consumed line: falls behind for a while, then catches up -->
                          <path d="M0,57 L40,53 L80,55 L120,48 L160,45 L200,49 L240,47 L280,50 L320,52 L360,44 L400,33 L440,34 L480,31 L520,28 L560,32 L600,29 L640,26" fill="none" stroke="#10b981" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="4 3"/>
                          <!-- Y-axis labels -->
                          <text x="2" y="23" fill="#9ca3af" font-size="8">120k/min</text>
                          <text x="2" y="48" fill="#9ca3af" font-size="8">80k/min</text>
                          <text x="2" y="73" fill="#9ca3af" font-size="8">40k/min</text>
                        </svg>
                      </div>

                      <!-- Discovery source breakdown -->
                      <div class="bg-white rounded-lg border border-gray-200 shadow-sm p-4">
                        <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-1">Discovered from</div>
                        <div class="text-[10px] text-gray-400 mb-4">What found each queue</div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
                          <div class="relative flex-shrink-0">
                            <svg viewBox="0 0 80 80" class="w-20 h-20">
                              <circle cx="40" cy="40" r="30" fill="none" stroke="#e5e7eb" stroke-width="8"/>
                              <circle cx="40" cy="40" r="30" fill="none" stroke="#6366f1" stroke-width="8" stroke-dasharray="133.93 188.5" stroke-dashoffset="0" transform="rotate(-90 40 40)"/>
                              <circle cx="40" cy="40" r="30" fill="none" stroke="#f59e0b" stroke-width="8" stroke-dasharray="44.64 188.5" stroke-dashoffset="-133.93" transform="rotate(-90 40 40)"/>
                              <circle cx="40" cy="40" r="30" fill="none" stroke="#9ca3af" stroke-width="8" stroke-dasharray="9.92 188.5" stroke-dashoffset="-178.57" transform="rotate(-90 40 40)"/>
                            </svg>
                            <div class="absolute inset-0 flex flex-col items-center justify-center">
                              <span class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900">38</span>
                            </div>
                          </div>
                          <div class="flex-1 space-y-1.5">
                            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                              <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500"></span><span class="text-[11px] text-gray-600">Application traces</span></div>
                              <span class="text-[11px] font-semibold text-gray-800">27</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                              <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-amber-500"></span><span class="text-[11px] text-gray-600">Broker metrics</span></div>
                              <span class="text-[11px] font-semibold text-gray-800">9</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                              <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-gray-400"></span><span class="text-[11px] text-gray-600">Added manually</span></div>
                              <span class="text-[11px] font-semibold text-gray-800">2</span>
                            </div>
                          </div>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Queue list -->
                    <div class="bg-white rounded-lg border border-gray-200 shadow-sm overflow-hidden">
                      <div class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-3 px-4 py-2.5 bg-gray-50 border-b border-gray-200 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-500">
                        <div class="col-span-7 md:col-span-3">Name</div>
                        <div class="col-span-5 md:col-span-3">System</div>
                        <div class="max-md:hidden md:block md:col-span-2">Broker</div>
                        <div class="max-md:hidden md:block md:col-span-2">Discovered from</div>
                        <div class="max-md:hidden md:block md:col-span-2">Last seen</div>
                      </div>
                      <div class="divide-y divide-gray-100">
                        <div class="grid grid-cols-12 items-center gap-3 px-4 py-2.5">
                          <div class="col-span-7 md:col-span-3 min-w-0 text-xs font-medium text-gray-900 truncate">orders</div>
                          <div class="col-span-5 md:col-span-3 text-xs text-gray-700">Apache Kafka</div>
                          <div class="max-md:hidden md:block md:col-span-2 text-[10px] font-mono text-gray-600 truncate">kafka-1:9092</div>
                          <div class="max-md:hidden md:block md:col-span-2 text-xs text-gray-600">Application traces</div>
                          <div class="max-md:hidden md:block md:col-span-2 text-xs text-gray-500">1 minute ago</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="grid grid-cols-12 items-center gap-3 px-4 py-2.5">
                          <div class="col-span-7 md:col-span-3 min-w-0 text-xs font-medium text-gray-900 truncate">payments</div>
                          <div class="col-span-5 md:col-span-3 text-xs text-gray-700">Azure Service Bus</div>
                          <div class="max-md:hidden md:block md:col-span-2 text-[10px] font-mono text-gray-600 truncate">shop-prod</div>
                          <div class="max-md:hidden md:block md:col-span-2 text-xs text-gray-600">Application traces</div>
                          <div class="max-md:hidden md:block md:col-span-2 text-xs text-gray-500">2 minutes ago</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="grid grid-cols-12 items-center gap-3 px-4 py-2.5">
                          <div class="col-span-7 md:col-span-3 min-w-0 text-xs font-medium text-gray-900 truncate">email-jobs</div>
                          <div class="col-span-5 md:col-span-3 text-xs text-gray-700">RabbitMQ</div>
                          <div class="max-md:hidden md:block md:col-span-2 text-[10px] font-mono text-gray-600 truncate">rabbitmq:5672</div>
                          <div class="max-md:hidden md:block md:col-span-2 text-xs text-gray-600">Application traces</div>
                          <div class="max-md:hidden md:block md:col-span-2 text-xs text-gray-500">1 minute ago</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="grid grid-cols-12 items-center gap-3 px-4 py-2.5">
                          <div class="col-span-7 md:col-span-3 min-w-0 text-xs font-medium text-gray-900 truncate">invoice-events</div>
                          <div class="col-span-5 md:col-span-3 text-xs text-gray-700">Amazon SQS</div>
                          <div class="max-md:hidden md:block md:col-span-2 text-xs text-gray-400">—</div>
                          <div class="max-md:hidden md:block md:col-span-2 text-xs text-gray-600">Broker metrics</div>
                          <div class="max-md:hidden md:block md:col-span-2 text-xs text-gray-500">14 minutes ago</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="grid grid-cols-12 items-center gap-3 px-4 py-2.5">
                          <div class="col-span-7 md:col-span-3 min-w-0 text-xs font-medium text-gray-900 truncate">clickstream-billing</div>
                          <div class="col-span-5 md:col-span-3 text-xs text-gray-700">Google Cloud Pub/Sub</div>
                          <div class="max-md:hidden md:block md:col-span-2 text-xs text-gray-400">—</div>
                          <div class="max-md:hidden md:block md:col-span-2 text-xs text-gray-600">Added manually</div>
                          <div class="max-md:hidden md:block md:col-span-2 text-xs text-gray-500">6 minutes ago</div>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <%- include('logo-roll') -%>

    <!-- What You Get Section -->
    <div class="relative bg-white py-24 sm:py-32" id="queues-sources">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 lg:px-8">
        <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center mb-16">
          <p class="text-sm font-medium text-indigo-600 uppercase tracking-wide mb-3">What You Get</p>
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-4xl text-balance">
            Three sources, one page per queue
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-gray-600">
            Traces tell OneUptime that a queue exists and how your applications use it. Only the broker knows how full it is. Everything that names the same queue joins its page, instead of making another.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
          <!-- Application traces -->
          <div class="flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-6 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-indigo-200 hover:shadow-lg">
            <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-yellow-50 ring-1 ring-yellow-200">
              <%- include('./Partials/icons/traces', {iconClass: 'h-5 w-5'}) %>
            </div>
            <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">Application traces</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Messages published and consumed, errors and processing time, the services on each side, and the traces themselves.</p>
            <p class="mt-auto pt-4 text-xs text-gray-500"><span class="font-semibold text-gray-700">Needs:</span> applications instrumented with OpenTelemetry.</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Broker metrics -->
          <div class="flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-indigo-200 bg-indigo-50/40 p-6 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-lg">
            <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-white ring-1 ring-indigo-200">
              <%- include('./Partials/icons/queues', {iconClass: 'h-5 w-5'}) %>
            </div>
            <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">Broker metrics</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Broker health: backlog, consumer lag, dead letters, oldest message age, throttling and the broker's own message rates.</p>
            <p class="mt-auto pt-4 text-xs text-gray-500"><span class="font-semibold text-gray-700">Needs:</span> an OpenTelemetry Collector with the receiver or scrape for your broker.</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Client metrics -->
          <div class="flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-6 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-indigo-200 hover:shadow-lg">
            <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-purple-50 ring-1 ring-purple-200">
              <%- include('./Partials/icons/metrics', {iconClass: 'h-5 w-5'}) %>
            </div>
            <h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">Client metrics</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">The message counts and durations your messaging clients report, and any queue gauge of your own, on the queue's Metrics tab.</p>
            <p class="mt-auto pt-4 text-xs text-gray-500"><span class="font-semibold text-gray-700">Needs:</span> instrumentation that reports OpenTelemetry messaging metrics.</p>
          </div>
