                </div>
                <h3 class="mt-6 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">Straight to the Trace</h3>
                <p class="mt-4 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">Every messaging span is tagged with its queue as it is ingested, so a queue's Traces tab holds every span that publishes to or consumes from it. The slow handler or the failed publish is one click from the chart that showed it.</p>
              </a>
            </div>

          </div>
