            <a href="/enterprise/self-hosted" class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-medium text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-700">Self-hosting guide <svg class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 4.5L21 12m0 0l-7.5 7.5" /></svg></a>
